  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞右边的路……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞女生们、虎狼丸、\n　善和玲都在……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}咦……那个肌肉男呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}看来，它把另一边\n当成了目标。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}糟了，肌肉男往这边来了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 08 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}但对手是Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ。\n没那么容易拦住它！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}普通的物理攻击不行……\n那么，其他的攻击方法……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 09 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}……对了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}什、什么！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}……不过，这个方法要用到食材……\n实在让我很心痛……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 05 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}现在不是顾虑这个的时候吧！\n被抓住就完了！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}嗯，顾不了那么多了！\n到底是什么方法！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}……天城学姐，现在带着便当吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 06 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}咦……嗯，带着呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0112",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 01 01 06 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}想着路上可能会饿，\n就和千枝她们提前做好了……\n你饿了吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}……光这样还不太放心。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}还有其他亲手做的食物吗，\n里中学姐！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}直接点名！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 19 01}有、有是有……\n这个行吗？\n刚才在摊位烤的手工玛芬。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞千枝拿出的玛芬，\n　不知为什么一片铁青……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 05 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 65 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1A 01}还有我做的曲奇哦？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:16:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1B 01}刚才交给千枝学姐了，\n说累了的时候让大家分着吃！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 07 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1C 01}啊，对哦。\n就是这个。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞千枝拿出的曲奇，\n　不知为什么一片通红……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1D 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}啊，我好像有点懂了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 65 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1E 01}那个，俄式牛肉烩饭\n怎么样呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:20:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1F 01}是我做的，\n刚才捏成饭团，\n交给埃癸斯了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 20 01}啊，不，这种正常的料理就……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}哎，我们的也很正常啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 22 01}没关系。\n那个也相当厉害。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 10 01 01 01 06 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 23 01}这就是风花做的饭团。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞埃癸斯拿出的饭团，\n　正在猛烈地喷出蒸汽……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 03 01 06 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 24 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}内部正在散发高热。\n温度已经升至刚捏好时的约两倍……\n而且还在继续上升！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 25 01}原、原来如此……真是太棒了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:28:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 26 01}可是，要拿这个做什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:28:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 27 01}要是想让大家吃了恢复精神，\n时间恐怕有点……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:29:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_028",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 28 01}扔出去。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:30:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_029",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 29 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}咦！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:31:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_030",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2A 01}让善连续发射这些，\n应该能造成相当可观的伤害。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:32:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK031",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}还是不太放心{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:32:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK031",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}混起来会更厉害{F5 47 02 01 02 01 0D 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:33:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2B 01}可是，已经没有别的手工食物了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:34:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_033",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2C 01}那么，混合起来如何？\n俗话说，一支箭易折，\n捆成一束便会坚不可摧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:35:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_034",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 09 01 03 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2D 01}原来如此……有道理！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:35:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_034",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2E 01}混起来，扔出去吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:36:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_035",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2F 01}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}等下……哎！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:37:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_036",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 07 01 0B 01 65 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 30 01}太过分了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:38:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK037",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}只有这个办法了{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:38:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK037",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}下次再做给我吃吧{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:38:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK037",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}这才是唯一的用途！{F5 47 02 01 02 01 0D 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:39:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_038",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 06 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 31 01}是、是吗？\n那么……拜托了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:40:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_039",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 06 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 32 01}嗯……我明白了。\n毕竟是为了脱离危险。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:40:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_039",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 33 01}虽然有点对不起食材……\n这次就拿去用吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:41:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_040",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 06 01 05 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 34 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}才、才不是！\n食物是用来吃的啊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:42:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_041",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 35 01}现在没有时间了。\n之后再请我们品尝吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:43:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_042",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 36 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}那好吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:44:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_043",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 13 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 37 01}……学长，到时候由你来吃哦！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:45:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_044",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞将雪子的便当、千枝的玛芬、\n　理世的曲奇、风花的饭团\n　混合在了一起……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:45:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_044",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:45:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_044",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞霎时间，周围弥漫起了\n　强烈的刺激性气味……！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:46:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_045",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 38 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}好、好难受……！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_043.bf.json:47:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_046",
